# Hub env template (empty values)

Copy to `/etc/mikromagic-hub/env` on the VPS. Fill from your password manager.
**Never commit a filled copy.**

```bash
# Magic Hub — must match Lovable VPS_ROUTER_* secrets
MM_HUB_SIGNING_KEY=
MM_HUB_SIGNING_KEY_ID=v1

# Public / listen (adjust to your deploy)
# MM_HUB_LISTEN=127.0.0.1:8787
# MM_HUB_PUBLIC_URL=https://hub.example/internal/provisioner

# WireGuard (hub-side) — keep private keys out of git
# MM_WG_INTERFACE=wg-mm
# MM_WG_SUBNET=10.77.0.0/24
```

App-side mirror (Lovable Secrets / `.env`):

```bash
VPS_ROUTER_API_URL=https://hub.example/internal/provisioner
VPS_ROUTER_API_KEY_ID=v1
VPS_ROUTER_API_SIGNING_SECRET=
VPS_ROUTER_WG_SUBNET=10.77.0.0/24
VPS_ROUTER_HUB_ROUTE=10.77.0.1/32
```
